WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:01.840
This step makes your past

2
00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:05.360
conversations easier to find.

3
00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:07.600
Continuum reads the files you've

4
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:10.080
selected and organizes the supported

5
00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:12.480
conversation text into a searchable

6
00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:13.680
collection.

7
00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.280
It keeps track of who

8
00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:17.200
said what and where each

9
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.120
passage came from.

10
00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:21.440
That distinction matters.

11
00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:24.000
Something an AI suggested isn't

12
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.800
automatically something you agreed with.

13
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:28.800
Keeping your messages separate from

14
00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:31.120
its replies helps preserve what

15
00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:32.800
actually happened.

16
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:35.120
Once this step finishes, you

17
00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:36.960
can search using words you

18
00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:38.720
remember, such as a project

19
00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:41.120
name or a phrase.

20
00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:42.800
The result points back to

21
00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:44.480
the conversation, so you can

22
00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:46.880
read it in context.

23
00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.880
This work happens on your

24
00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:50.320
Mac.

25
00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:51.760
It doesn't need to send

26
00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:53.360
the conversations to an AI

27
00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:54.240
service.

28
00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:56.800
Your original downloaded files stay

29
00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:58.590
unchanged.

30
00:00:58.590 --> 00:01:00.430
The estimate below gives you

31
00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:01.470
an idea of how long

32
00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:03.150
it may take.

33
00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:05.870
Your file size and computer

34
00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:08.350
affect the actual time.

35
00:01:08.350 --> 00:01:10.190
If the work is interrupted,

36
00:01:10.190 --> 00:01:12.510
Continuum can continue from saved

37
00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:14.670
progress.

38
00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:17.070
Making something searchable doesn't mean

39
00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:18.190
the AI has read and

40
00:01:18.190 --> 00:01:19.070
understood all of it.

41
00:01:19.070 --> 00:01:20.910
Learning useful preferences and lessons

42
00:01:20.910 --> 00:01:22.510
is a separate step coming

43
00:01:22.510 --> 00:01:25.710
up later.

44
00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:28.110
After this finishes, the assistant

45
00:01:28.110 --> 00:01:29.470
will show what was brought

46
00:01:29.470 --> 00:01:30.990
in and help you try

47
00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:32.430
a search.

48
00:01:32.430 --> 00:01:33.550
Would you like to build

49
00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:35.830
your searchable history now?
